[245.534773, "o", "wrote output/result.json: decision=no_ship diff=+0.00096 ci=[-0.00432, +0.00624] srm_p=0.469\r\n"]
[245.617507, "o", "===\r\n"]
[245.618668, "o", "{\r\n  \"experiment\": \"EXP-2291\",\r\n  \"n_users\": {\r\n    \"A\": 16570,\r\n    \"B\": 16702\r\n  },\r\n  \"pageviews\": {\r\n    \"A\": 165646,\r\n    \"B\": 167279\r\n  },\r\n  \"clicks\": {\r\n    \"A\": 16436,\r\n    \"B\": 16759\r\n  },\r\n  \"ctr\": {\r\n    \"A\": 0.09922364560568923,\r\n    \"B\": 0.10018591694115818\r\n  },\r\n  \"diff\": 0.0009622713354689449,\r\n  \"rel_lift\": 0.00969800423674184,\r\n  \"ci_95\": [\r\n    -0.004315790679054589,\r\n    0.006240333349992479\r\n  ],\r\n  \"ci_method\": \"delta method, users as the unit\",\r\n  \"srm_p\": 0.46927458833703506,\r\n  \"srm_flag\": false,\r\n  \"decision\": \"no_ship\",\r\n  \"notes\": [\r\n    \"Counted 16570 A and 16702 B users (method='hash', ua_crawler bots excluded); SRM chi-square p=0.4693, no sample ratio mismatch. CTR A=9.9224%, B=10.0186%, diff=+0.00096; 95% CI [-0.00432, +0.00624] crosses zero, so the module does not show a clear change in click-through.\",\r\n"]
[245.618705, "o", "    \"Three earlier bugs were fixed. (1) Bot exclusion now drops only users flagged by ua_crawler, the rule that looks at who the client is; users flagged by 'velocity' were wrongly removed even though that rule reacts to what a user did, not to the client, so they are kept. (2) Users whose variant was set by hand (method='override', the dogfood/QA allowlist) are not part of the randomized experiment and are excluded, so only the hash-randomized 50/50 split is read. (3) A 'click' is a pageview from which the user opened a related product page (module_click target 'item:<product_id>'); carousel arrows (nav:prev/nav:next) and the 'See all' link (link:all) do not open a product page and are not counted, so the precomputed dashboard 'clicked' column was replaced by recomputing from module_clicks.\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n"]
[245.618877, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[245.618899, "o", "root@47a5409d-3b7f-4859-aafa-80cf71d1d559:/app# "]
[316.077369, "i", "cd /app && python3 -c \"\nimport pandas as pd\na=pd.read_csv('data/assignments.csv.gz').drop_duplicates()\na=a[a.method=='hash']\nb=pd.read_csv('data/bot_flags.csv.gz')\nua=set(b.query('rule==\\\"ua_crawler\\\"').user_id)\nvel=set(b.query('rule==\\\"velocity\\\"').user_id)\nfor arm in ['A','B']:\n    s=set(a.query(\\\"variant=='%s'%\\\"%arm).user_id)\n    print(arm,'hash',len(s),'ua_only',len(s&ua-vel),'vel_only',len(s&vel-ua),'both',len(s&ua&vel))\n\"\n"]
